4
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,519
The Olympiad mathematics contest is next month.

5
00:01:52,079 --> 00:01:53,120
I need to do more exercises.

6
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,439
Yang, I'm sorry.

7
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:01,280
I worked late today.

8
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,439
I didn't cook for you.

9
00:02:02,959 --> 00:02:03,719
It's okay.

10
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:05,799
Are you full?

11
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:06,560
Yes.

12
00:02:06,719 --> 00:02:07,719
If you get hungry later,

13
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:08,520
I'll make you something.

14
00:02:09,919 --> 00:02:12,039
Then let me work overtime with you.

15
00:02:13,639 --> 00:02:14,719
Come on, Yang.

16
00:02:15,039 --> 00:02:17,240
Let's work together.

17
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:18,400
Good luck, Mom.

18
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:19,080
Good luck.

19
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:31,800
Yang,

20
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,120
is your study

21
00:02:33,120 --> 00:02:34,719
a bit tough lately?

22
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:35,919
I think you've lost

23
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:37,000
some weight.

24
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,960
I've been training in the basketball club.

25
00:02:39,879 --> 00:02:40,479
I've got stronger.

26
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,879
Let me feel it.

27
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:45,120
You are indeed stronger.

28
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:48,120
It's late at night.

29
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,639
Don't drink too much coffee.

30
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:51,159
Okay, no more coffee.

31
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:51,919
Here you are.

32
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,000
Thank you.

33
00:03:04,199 --> 00:03:04,879
Yang,

34
00:03:04,879 --> 00:03:05,960
remember,

35
00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:08,120
you have to go to bed

36
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,319
by 12:00.

37
00:03:09,319 --> 00:03:10,080
Do you hear me?

38
00:03:11,719 --> 00:03:12,400
Yes, ma'am.

39
00:03:12,599 --> 00:03:13,759
Okay, get to it.

40
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:21,960
A sequence of numbers

41
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,360
arranged in a certain order

42
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,599
like this

43
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,759
is called a sequence,

44
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,840
Each number in the sequence

45
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,599
is called an item.

46
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:32,400
If we categorize by the number of items,

47
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,520
there are finite sequences

48
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,680
and infinite sequences.

49
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:38,560
In memory of Zhou Yu in his heyday,

50
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:40,280
when he just married Xiao Qiao,

51
00:03:40,719 --> 00:03:42,120
he was vigorous and valiant,

52
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:44,280
with feather fan and silk scarf,

53
00:03:44,719 --> 00:03:46,080
he destroyed the enemy

54
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:48,319
with ease and laughter.

55
00:03:48,319 --> 00:03:49,680
In my dreams, I return to my homeland...

56
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,319
What's wrong?

57
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,319
I'm so sleepy.

58
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:53,439
Poke me.

59
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,240
Lin Qingyuan,

60
00:03:59,159 --> 00:04:00,159
go stand at the back.

61
00:04:05,159 --> 00:04:05,759
Class,

62
00:04:05,960 --> 00:04:06,879
today we're going to learn

63
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:08,000
the complex uses

64
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,039
of modal verbs.

65
00:04:09,039 --> 00:04:11,360
Must indicates certainty.

66
00:04:11,639 --> 00:04:12,879
When we're negating,

67
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:13,879
we use can't.

68
00:04:14,159 --> 00:04:15,039
For uncertainty,

69
00:04:15,039 --> 00:04:16,000
we use may,

70
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,199
should,

71
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:17,680
would,

72
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,720
and might.

73
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,079
So when using

74
00:04:20,079 --> 00:04:21,439
modal verbs...

75
00:04:21,959 --> 00:04:22,759
Ms. Wang,

76
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,160
this is the proposal for Reading Week.

77
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,160
Please take a look.

78
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:26,959
Okay.

79
00:04:29,600 --> 00:04:30,519
Wait for me to finish reading it.

80
00:04:30,959 --> 00:04:31,839
Zhou Yang,

81
00:04:32,079 --> 00:04:33,600
are you feeling a bit tired lately?

82
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:35,199
Remember to balance work and rest.

83
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:36,879
I understand, ma'am.

84
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:38,079
I'll head back to the classroom now.

85
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:38,680
Go ahead.

86
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:51,920
Are you okay, Zhou Yang?

87
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:53,519
I'm fine.

88
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,680
Let's continue.

89
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,399
That's all

90
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:01,600
for today's class.

91
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:04,079
Goodbye, teacher.

92
00:05:17,439 --> 00:05:18,439
Why don't you write down

93
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:20,360
your mistakes in your notebook?

94
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,720
Do you understand what this means?

95
00:05:22,959 --> 00:05:24,720
Sorry, I don't know.

96
00:05:25,199 --> 00:05:25,920
I've asked you

97
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:26,879
ten questions.

98
00:05:26,879 --> 00:05:27,959
Don't you know any of them?

99
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:28,839
Yes.

100
00:05:31,279 --> 00:05:32,720
Mr. Zhou, please.

101
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:38,439
Why don't you write our mistakes

102
00:05:38,439 --> 00:05:40,120
on the blackboard?

103
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,560
Okay, I will.

104
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,240
Are you kidding me?

105
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:45,759
Yes.

106
00:05:48,680 --> 00:05:50,720
Mr. Zhou, go on.

107
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,399
Okay.

108
00:05:51,879 --> 00:05:53,000
Why don't we write down our mistakes

109
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:54,480
in the notebook?

110
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:56,240
This sentence means

111
00:05:56,319 --> 00:05:57,439
we should write down our mistakes

112
00:05:57,439 --> 00:05:58,879
in our mistake notebook.

113
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,480
Take a break first.

114
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,759
Your steps are unsteady.

115
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:53,519
Challenge.

116
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,480
Action.

117
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:00,680
Focus.

118
00:07:02,040 --> 00:07:03,319
Suitable.

119
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,199
Can you not disturb me?

120
00:07:09,399 --> 00:07:10,480
Okay.

121
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,839
Juice?

122
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,639
Sorry, please leave.

123
00:07:14,079 --> 00:07:15,279
Good night.

124
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:18,639
Target.

125
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,399
Forward.

126
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,120
Replicated during interphase

127
00:07:45,120 --> 00:07:45,920
during the interphase.

128
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,800
It consists of prophase, metaphase,

129
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,680
anaphase, and telophase.

130
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:05,079
Interphase...

131
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,519
Impressive.

132
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,039
What's up with Zhou Yang?

133
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:09,960
I don't know.

134
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:11,519
Something feels off.

135
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,840
Zhou Yang,

136
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:15,120
what's going on?

137
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:16,559
You don't look well.

138
00:09:18,039 --> 00:09:18,799
It's nothing.

139
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,759
It won't affect my exam tomorrow.

140
00:09:29,159 --> 00:09:30,919
Midterms are tomorrow.

141
00:09:32,279 --> 00:09:33,360
Yibei Basketball Club.

142
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:41,960
Good luck on the exam.

143
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,360
Lin Qingyuan,

144
00:10:02,840 --> 00:10:04,000
are you ready?

145
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:05,399
Yes.

146
00:10:05,399 --> 00:10:06,360
Li Haoyu,

147
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,080
what about you?

148
00:10:12,559 --> 00:10:13,200
Go.

149
00:10:15,879 --> 00:10:16,639
Chinese.

150
00:10:19,399 --> 00:10:20,120
Passed.

151
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,279
Math.

152
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,399
Passed.

153
00:10:26,519 --> 00:10:27,320
English.

154
00:10:27,799 --> 00:10:29,399
Great, also passed.

155
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:29,720
And you?

156
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,559
Let's see yours.

157
00:10:31,039 --> 00:10:31,879
I...

158
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,399
Chinese passed.

159
00:10:49,120 --> 00:10:50,039
Math.

160
00:10:50,879 --> 00:10:51,600
Passed.

161
00:10:52,879 --> 00:10:54,159
History also passed.

162
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:59,519
Next is the final round.

163
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:03,519
Physics.

164
00:11:04,639 --> 00:11:05,440
Physics.

165
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,600
63.

166
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:10,600
Passed.

167
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:12,519
I've all passed. That's great.

168
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:16,399
Wait a moment, wait a moment, wait a moment.

169
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:20,240
You check my geography score for me.

170
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:20,919
Okay.

171
00:11:20,919 --> 00:11:22,279
I really can't take it anymore.

172
00:11:23,799 --> 00:11:24,960
The last digit.

173
00:11:26,759 --> 00:11:27,840
It's six.

174
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:28,919
Tens place, tens place.

175
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,919
The tens digit, the tens digit is...

176
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:32,879
Six.

177
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:33,879
Lin Qingyuan,

178
00:11:33,879 --> 00:11:35,399
your geography score is 66.

179
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:38,080
You passed.

180
00:11:42,279 --> 00:11:43,519
It's really 66 points.

181
00:11:43,919 --> 00:11:45,200
I passed all the subjects too.

182
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:46,559
Our rankings are safe.

183
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:48,399
We can continue to compete.

184
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:50,080
That's great.

185
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:52,200
Li Haoyu, catch the ball.

186
00:12:00,559 --> 00:12:01,799
It's not easy.

187
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:02,679
Let's go.

188
00:12:03,240 --> 00:12:04,279
Let's tell everyone

189
00:12:04,279 --> 00:12:04,960
this good news.

190
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:05,519
Okay.

191
00:12:12,960 --> 00:12:14,080
How did you two do?

192
00:12:21,559 --> 00:12:22,080
Don't be like this.

193
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,360
Say something.

194
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:33,759
Gu Chenyang.

195
00:12:33,759 --> 00:12:35,320
Are they going to cry?

196
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,360
Anyway,

197
00:12:43,679 --> 00:12:45,639
you've tried your best.

198
00:12:46,120 --> 00:12:47,480
So, actually...

199
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:53,120
You really believe we didn't pass?

200
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:53,960
Don't you know

201
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:55,039
who I am.

202
00:12:55,399 --> 00:12:56,879
We all passed.

203
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,799
And our grades are all good.

204
00:12:58,799 --> 00:12:59,559
Come on.

205
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:00,960
You scared me.

206
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:07,200
You two did well.

207
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,519
Your grades have improved a lot.

208
00:13:09,960 --> 00:13:10,559
We can finally

209
00:13:10,559 --> 00:13:11,720
prepare for the competition.

210
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:12,080
Yes.

211
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:14,759
Mr. Gu,

212
00:13:15,159 --> 00:13:16,759
you deserve half the credit.

213
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:17,879
Yes.

214
00:13:20,279 --> 00:13:21,320
Where's Mr. Zhou?

215
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,600
Why isn't he here

216
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:23,720
for such an important moment?

217
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,559
Right.

218
00:13:31,799 --> 00:13:32,960
Zhou Yang

219
00:13:34,399 --> 00:13:36,000
didn't do well this time.

220
00:14:33,159 --> 00:14:34,200
Congrats.

221
00:14:34,879 --> 00:14:36,399
You're the top student in the grade.

222
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,080
I...

223
00:14:52,279 --> 00:14:52,879
I thought

224
00:14:52,879 --> 00:14:54,639
I could do everything well.

225
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:57,679
I'm sorry to make a fool of myself.

226
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,600
It's not funny.

227
00:15:07,879 --> 00:15:08,960
Don't you feel tired?

228
00:15:11,639 --> 00:15:12,840
Let me be frank.

229
00:15:13,799 --> 00:15:15,000
Is it worth it

230
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:16,639
for the basketball club?

231
00:15:19,600 --> 00:15:20,879
Zhou Yang used to

232
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:23,279
never have such a big drop

233
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,639
in his academic performance.

234
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:32,320
If everyone can do better,

235
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,639
I think it's worth it.

236
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,919
After all, the Basketball Club

237
00:15:36,919 --> 00:15:38,120
is not just about one person.

238
00:15:44,559 --> 00:15:45,679
I just think

239
00:15:47,480 --> 00:15:48,639
when will you

240
00:15:49,399 --> 00:15:50,840
think more about yourself?

241
00:16:10,879 --> 00:16:12,320
It's all because we are not competitive enough,

242
00:16:12,639 --> 00:16:13,759
which has held Zhou Yang back.

243
00:16:14,200 --> 00:16:15,639
Fortunately, I didn't fail this time.

244
00:16:16,399 --> 00:16:17,960
or I'd be ashamed to see him.

245
00:16:18,759 --> 00:16:20,039
Why aren't they talking?

246
00:16:21,159 --> 00:16:21,960
I wonder if Fu Binyan

247
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:23,039
will scold him.

248
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:26,320
Should we go check?

249
00:16:27,039 --> 00:16:27,679
No need.

250
00:16:29,559 --> 00:16:30,919
Let's go back to training.

251
00:16:31,759 --> 00:16:33,159
Aren't you worried about Zhou Yang?

252
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:35,200
Of course,

253
00:16:35,759 --> 00:16:36,440
but right now,

254
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:37,639
the only thing we can do

255
00:16:37,639 --> 00:16:39,320
is to prepare for the next game,

256
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,519
and not let his hard work go to waste.

257
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:48,360
We must win this game.

258
00:16:48,720 --> 00:16:49,399
Let's go.

259
00:17:27,759 --> 00:17:28,960
I'll get in the car right away.

260
00:18:22,319 --> 00:18:23,640
Haven't you answered the phone yet?

261
00:18:27,559 --> 00:18:28,480
What's going on?

262
00:18:28,480 --> 00:18:29,319
The game will start

263
00:18:29,319 --> 00:18:30,160
in ten minutes.

264
00:18:32,519 --> 00:18:34,119
He's not someone who would be late.

265
00:18:34,519 --> 00:18:35,920
Could something have happened to him?

266
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:42,839
Coach Su

267
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,319
Please designate the starting members

268
00:18:44,319 --> 00:18:45,000
and sign.

269
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,079
Let the substitutes start.

270
00:18:55,079 --> 00:18:56,559
Don't just stand there. Get warmed up.

271
00:18:57,039 --> 00:18:58,079
Okay, coach.

272
00:18:58,799 --> 00:18:59,480
Xu Anbo

273
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,559
Let Chi Jia continue to contact.

274
00:19:00,759 --> 00:19:02,160
Notify me if anything happens.

275
00:19:41,519 --> 00:19:42,279
You're awake.

276
00:19:45,799 --> 00:19:47,079
Why are you here?

277
00:19:47,839 --> 00:19:49,000
I took the bus

278
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,559
to the basketball hall this morning

279
00:19:51,640 --> 00:19:53,000
and saw you faint.

280
00:19:53,799 --> 00:19:56,039
The basketball hall, right.

281
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:01,359
Lie down.

282
00:20:03,279 --> 00:20:04,920
What time is it now?

283
00:20:05,119 --> 00:20:06,000
The game

284
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,400
is over.

285
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:13,839
What's the result?

286
00:20:15,759 --> 00:20:17,160
54 to 72.

287
00:20:18,240 --> 00:20:19,119
Yibei lost.

288
00:20:26,599 --> 00:20:28,440
Because I didn't show up.

289
00:20:32,039 --> 00:20:32,599
You fainted

290
00:20:32,599 --> 00:20:33,880
from low blood sugar,

291
00:20:35,119 --> 00:20:37,119
plus lack of sleep

292
00:20:37,480 --> 00:20:38,599
and overexertion.

293
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,240
You'd

294
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:41,759
just hold us back

295
00:20:42,119 --> 00:20:43,319
if you'd played.

296
00:20:44,720 --> 00:20:45,720
I told you,

297
00:20:47,039 --> 00:20:48,319
don't be so self-reliant.

298
00:20:51,960 --> 00:20:52,880
Yeah,

299
00:20:56,599 --> 00:20:58,200
I'm not strong enough.

300
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:03,160
I mean,

301
00:21:04,119 --> 00:21:05,039
no one can carry everything

302
00:21:05,039 --> 00:21:06,160
by themselves.

303
00:21:07,640 --> 00:21:09,079
Not even superheroes.

304
00:21:12,519 --> 00:21:13,839
Back in the basketball club,

305
00:21:14,400 --> 00:21:15,319
the seniors

306
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:17,079
pushed everything onto you,

307
00:21:17,839 --> 00:21:18,680
and you took it all.

308
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:21,079
You suddenly missed a game

309
00:21:22,079 --> 00:21:23,279
was because of Auntie Xiao's

310
00:21:23,279 --> 00:21:24,359
sudden appendicitis.

311
00:21:25,839 --> 00:21:27,160
You had to rush to the hospital.

312
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:29,440
Later,

313
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,599
you had to take care of her

314
00:21:31,119 --> 00:21:32,240
while preparing for the final exam.

315
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:34,279
But you,

316
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:36,519
didn't explain anything.

317
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:38,519
Even now,

318
00:21:39,519 --> 00:21:41,039
they still hold a grudge against you.

319
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:43,119
I...

320
00:21:43,640 --> 00:21:44,400
I just don't want to

321
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:45,720
cause any trouble for them.

322
00:21:50,079 --> 00:21:51,119
What about your mom?

323
00:21:52,079 --> 00:21:53,240
With all that's happened,

324
00:21:54,119 --> 00:21:55,400
doesn't she know anything?

325
00:21:56,799 --> 00:21:58,200
She's been busy with work.

326
00:21:58,920 --> 00:21:59,880
I don't want to

327
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:01,119
add any more burden to her.

328
00:22:01,319 --> 00:22:02,119
So,

329
00:22:02,119 --> 00:22:04,319
your emergency contact is your dad?

330
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:10,160
Zhou Yang,

331
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:12,759
do you think this is being sensible?

332
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:16,400
This is being foolish, you know?

333
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:32,839
Zhou Yang,

334
00:22:33,920 --> 00:22:35,039
sometimes,

335
00:22:35,559 --> 00:22:37,039
you have to be willing to bother others.

336
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:42,599
Otherwise,

337
00:22:43,640 --> 00:22:45,240
you'll make those who truly care about you

338
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:46,519
feel heartbroken.

339
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:51,519
After finishing the IV drip,

340
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,759
remember to eat something sweet.

341
00:23:27,119 --> 00:23:27,839
Zhou Yang

342
00:23:30,960 --> 00:23:32,039
Why are you here?

343
00:23:32,240 --> 00:23:33,319
Zhou Yang

344
00:23:33,319 --> 00:23:34,519
Why didn't you tell us?

345
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:35,720
Yeah.

346
00:23:35,720 --> 00:23:36,799
You scared us.

347
00:23:36,960 --> 00:23:37,839
Are you feeling better?

348
00:23:39,039 --> 00:23:39,880
Yes.

349
00:23:40,559 --> 00:23:41,960
I just finished the infusion.

350
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:44,559
I'm sorry.

351
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,519
I couldn't make it to the competition.

352
00:23:49,920 --> 00:23:51,440
Fu Binyan has told us.

353
00:23:51,880 --> 00:23:52,839
You should have a good rest.

354
00:23:52,839 --> 00:23:54,359
Don't think about anything else.

355
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:55,480
That's right.

356
00:23:56,359 --> 00:23:57,759
You are more important than the match.

357
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,160
But next...

358
00:23:59,160 --> 00:24:00,359
There is no but.

359
00:24:00,759 --> 00:24:02,160
If anyone should say sorry,

360
00:24:02,160 --> 00:24:03,200
it should be us.

361
00:24:04,279 --> 00:24:05,559
We didn't do well,

362
00:24:06,039 --> 00:24:07,240
but you are tired like this.

363
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:10,240
We should be the ones apologizing.

364
00:24:11,359 --> 00:24:12,400
And we lost a race

365
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,039
we should've won.

366
00:24:16,079 --> 00:24:16,960
It's my fault

367
00:24:16,960 --> 00:24:18,240
for not keeping an eye

368
00:24:18,720 --> 00:24:20,359
on your condition.

369
00:24:23,000 --> 00:24:24,160
Alright,

370
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,519
stop it.

371
00:24:25,680 --> 00:24:26,920
Are you holding

372
00:24:27,359 --> 00:24:28,720
a review meeting here?

373
00:24:30,079 --> 00:24:31,119
Lin Qingyuan's right.

374
00:24:31,119 --> 00:24:32,720
The most important thing now

375
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:33,759
is to get well.

376
00:24:35,359 --> 00:24:36,599
Haven't you eaten yet?

377
00:24:36,599 --> 00:24:38,240
Name your order.

378
00:24:38,759 --> 00:24:39,559
It's on me.

379
00:24:40,279 --> 00:24:40,920
Stop it.

380
00:24:41,640 --> 00:24:43,599
He's sick. He can't eat.

381
00:24:43,599 --> 00:24:44,559
He can only eat porridge.

382
00:24:46,079 --> 00:24:47,039
But

383
00:24:47,039 --> 00:24:48,319
I really want a hamburger.

384
00:24:48,839 --> 00:24:50,079
You're really taking advantage.

385
00:24:50,079 --> 00:24:51,319
Give me my phone back.

386
00:24:51,319 --> 00:24:52,920
I just need the payment password.

387
00:24:52,920 --> 00:24:53,640
Payment for what? Seriously.

388
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:54,799
Stop arguing.

389
00:24:55,200 --> 00:24:56,599
Don't you see where you are?

390
00:24:59,640 --> 00:25:00,720
What did the doctor say?

391
00:25:00,960 --> 00:25:02,400
When can he be discharged?

392
00:25:02,799 --> 00:25:03,720
He should be able to leave tomorrow.

393
00:25:04,759 --> 00:25:05,920
Don't worry.

394
00:25:07,400 --> 00:25:09,160
I'll stay with you tonight.

395
00:25:09,759 --> 00:25:11,480
No, I'll stay here.

396
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:13,240
My family doesn't care about me anyway.

397
00:25:13,839 --> 00:25:15,079
You don't have to stay.

398
00:25:15,720 --> 00:25:16,920
My mom will be here soon.

399
00:25:17,279 --> 00:25:18,880
You've had a long day.

400
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:19,839
Go home early.

401
00:25:22,599 --> 00:25:23,400
Well,

402
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:25,359
will your mom really come?

403
00:25:26,480 --> 00:25:27,559
Why do you ask?

404
00:25:29,599 --> 00:25:30,519
I'm afraid you

405
00:25:30,799 --> 00:25:32,359
just don't want to bother us

406
00:25:32,359 --> 00:25:34,160
and didn't tell your family the truth.

407
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,559
This time it's real.

408
00:25:42,200 --> 00:25:43,000
That's good.

409
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:48,279
Take a good rest.

410
00:25:48,599 --> 00:25:49,480
Take a good rest.

411
00:25:52,400 --> 00:25:53,359
Thank you.

412
00:25:55,839 --> 00:25:56,559
Bye.

413
00:25:56,640 --> 00:25:57,519
We're leaving. Bye.

414
00:26:07,640 --> 00:26:09,400
Don't look at me. Go back.

415
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:12,920
You must take a good rest.
